# Public feed

Only `ComplaintStatus::Published` is public. Use `Complaint::scopePublished`. Anonymous complaints show submitter as "Anonymous".

Routes: `home` (`/`), `feed.show` (`/feed/{complaint}`), `feed.react` (auth POST).

One reaction per user per complaint (`reactions` unique on complaint_id + user_id). Types: spitting, cursing, shoe_throwing, burning, disgust, outrage. Guests see counts and a login/register prompt.

Nav lives in `layouts/navigation.blade.php` for the app layout. Guest auth pages use `layouts/guest.blade.php` (`auth.mdc`). Keep a public Team link (`staff.mdc`).
